#: ../../.opencode/commands/decide.md:4
msgid ""
"**Before creating any file**, check whether the user is working in a sub-"
"folder workspace. If so, preserve that workspace's `subproject:` "
"frontmatter and write the decision under the workspace's `.hero/` root; "
"otherwise write under the project `.hero/` root."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/decide.md:6
msgid ""
"Route this architectural decision to `architecture-reviewer` for "
"structured evaluation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/decide.md:8
msgid "The reviewer will:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/decide.md:9
msgid ""
"Call `hero_anchor` with the decision context to load project mission and "
"tripwires (forbidden options). Eliminate any option that appears in the "
"tripwire list before evaluating — do not present it as an option with "
"caveats."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/decide.md:10
msgid "Clarify the decision and its constraints"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/decide.md:11
msgid "Evaluate the options with tradeoff analysis"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/decide.md:12
msgid ""
"Consider architectural fit, operational burden, team impact, and "
"reversibility"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/decide.md:13
msgid "Produce a decision spec with recommendation, rationale, and consequences"
msgstr ""

